OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright but rather breezy day
OL,6,Fwith a few sunny spells, mainly in the
OL,7,Feast, between light scattered showers,
OL,8,Fthese most likely in the west.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FAny showers tending to die
OL,11,Fout through the evening and although
OL,12,Fcloudy at first, clear spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping later with lighter westerly
OL,14,Fwinds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FA bright start on Wednesday
OL,17,Fbut some light rain or showers
OL,18,Fdeveloping in the afternoon, a few
OL,19,Fshowers turning heavy, with some
OL,20,Fthunder, in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
